=head1 NAME

SDL3::API::Surface - functions and constants declared in SDL_surface.h

=head1 SYNOPSIS

  use SDL3::API::Surface ':all';

=head1 DESCRIPTION

Low-level binding generated from the C header. Functions keep their C
names and argument order. Pointers to structs are objects, out parameters
take scalar references, C<void *> becomes a L<SDL3::Pointer>.

