=item dst - SDL3::IOStream object or undef. a data stream to save to.

=item closeio - boolean. if true, calls SDL_CloseIO() on `dst` before returning, even in the case of an error.

=back

Returns boolean: true on success or false on failure; call SDL_GetError() for more information.

Since: This function is available since SDL 3.2.0.

