=head1 ENUMERATIONS

Every enumerator is exported as a constant sub.

=head2 SDL_ScaleMode

The scaling mode.

=over

=item SDL_SCALEMODE_INVALID = -1

=item SDL_SCALEMODE_NEAREST = 0 - nearest pixel sampling

=item SDL_SCALEMODE_LINEAR = 1 - linear filtering

=item SDL_SCALEMODE_PIXELART = 2 - nearest pixel sampling with improved scaling for pixel art, available since SDL 3.4.0

=back

=head2 SDL_FlipMode

The flip mode.

=over

=item SDL_FLIP_NONE = 0 - Do not flip

=item SDL_FLIP_HORIZONTAL = 1 - flip horizontally

=item SDL_FLIP_VERTICAL = 2 - flip vertically

=item SDL_FLIP_HORIZONTAL_AND_VERTICAL = 3 - flip horizontally and vertically (not a diagonal flip)

=back



